          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Our Story"
          }
        },
        "heading_gdLHxn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Veloura, <em>made by hand</em>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "enable_highlight_text_color": false,
            "heading_size": "h-xl"
          }
        },
        "text_KRQ7VA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We are a small atelier making jewelry the slow way: Japanese Miyuki beads placed one at a time, gold vermeil cast over recycled sterling, pearls matched by hand for lustre. No mass production, no shortcuts — every piece is finished, checked, and wrapped by hand before it leaves the workshop.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
